WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
Neuroformer makes four contributions.

00:00:02.747 --> 00:00:08.013
It reframes spike analysis as self-supervised
autoregressive generation,

00:00:08.093 --> 00:00:09.350
needing no labels.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:15.290
Its cross-attention scales linearly with feature
size and fuses many modalities.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:20.339
On simulated data, its attention maps recover
directed connectivity,

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:23.383
including hub neurons correlation misses.

00:00:23.463 --> 00:00:27.690
Pretrained, it decodes behavior with few-shot fine-tuning.
